('elan-the-emperor','T12','102',67,'B+','NE','{"morning":66,"cool":48,"vastu":48,"view":100,"airflow":90,"floor":97}'::jsonb,'{"overall":"NE-facing is the most auspicious orientation — ideal for the entrance and living zone; the Ishan corner draws positive energy.","rooms":{"entrance":{"dir":"NW","score":3,"ideal":"NE","reason":"The main door is most auspicious in the NE, N or E (the Ishan–Kuber arc); W and NW are workable; S, SW and SE entries are cautioned and rely on remedies."},"living":{"dir":"NW","score":3,"ideal":"NE","reason":"Living room in the NE or north draws prosperity; seating should face east or north. Keep the NE corner light and uncluttered."},"masterBed":{"dir":"SE","score":2,"ideal":"SW","reason":"Master bedroom in the SW (earth zone) promotes restful sleep and stability. Sleep with head pointing south or east."},"kitchen":{"dir":"SW","score":2,"ideal":"SE","reason":"Kitchen belongs in the SE (Agni corner); south works, NW is a fallback. NE or north kitchens set fire and water energies in conflict."},"bed2":{"dir":"NE","score":3,"ideal":"W","reason":"Secondary bedrooms suit the west or south — stable, with afternoon light. NE is acceptable for unmarried children."},"bed3":{"dir":"S","score":2,"ideal":"NW","reason":"Guest and children’s rooms suit the NW (Vayu zone). Children sleep with head to the south or east; avoid the SE for kids."},"pooja":{"dir":"W","score":2,"ideal":"NE","reason":"Puja room belongs in the NE (Ishan kona) — the most sacred zone. Deity faces east or west; the devotee faces east or north."},"bathroom":{"dir":"E","score":2,"ideal":"NW","reason":"Toilets belong in the NW or west. The NE (Ishan kona) must never host a wet area; SW toilets weaken household stability."}}}'::jsonb,'{"lake":false,"corner":true}'::jsonb,'{"sun_winter_h":1.118414,"sun_am_h":1.118414,"sun_pm_h":0,"rank":{"overall":2,"of":15,"morning":1,"cool":4,"vastu":10,"view":1,"airflow":8,"floor":7},"weakest_dim":"cool"}'::jsonb),
